     tips = {"Out of combat it Charges (8-25 yards: 9 Rage and a 1-second stun). In combat the same button queues Heroic Strike.", "After a kill one press selects the nearest enemy, so you can chain pulls without touching targeting.", "Too close to Charge? Keep pressing: you swing, and once the fight starts it queues Heroic Strike."}},
    {name = "Fight", title = "Charge stance dance / Sunder", icon = "ability_warrior_charge", lo = 10, hi = 24,
