     tips = {"Select the loose enemy, or select the party member it is hitting: Taunt goes to that member's target. With a mouse, hovering the enemy works too.", "Sunder Armor follows on the same press (Taunt is off the global cooldown), so the enemy turns with some of your threat already on it.", "Outside Defensive the first press switches stance."}},
