     tips = {"Press when melee hits are coming: 75% more block chance for up to two blocks in 7 sec, off the global cooldown.", "If Revenge is already lit it goes out on the same press. The Revenge button does the reverse, so either button gives you both when both are ready.", "Needs a shield. Outside Defensive the first press switches stance."}},
    {name = "Victory Rush", title = "Victory Rush", icon = "ability_warrior_devastate", lo = 20, hi = 60,
