 "Fireball (Rank 10)"}, notes = {"Root, then Shatter. Your core defensive.", "Instant AoE on nova'd packs.", "Instant finisher. Shares its 8 sec cooldown with Ice Lance (Blizzard, 2 Nov): Lance if frozen, else Fire Blast.", "Rarely useful.", "Frostbolt replaces it at 4."}, icons = {"spell_frost_frostnova", "spell_nature_wispsplode", "spell_fire_fireball", "spell_holy_flashheal", "spell_fire_flamebolt"}}, {level = 56, spells = {"Frostbolt (Rank 10)", "Ice Lance (Rank 6)", "Arcane Intellect (Rank 5)", "Arcane Brilliance", "Arcane Missiles (Rank 8)", "Flamestrike (Rank 6)"}, notes = {"Your main nuke. Always train new ranks.", "New rank of your Shatter button.", "Keep it up — more mana.", "Group buff; needs Arcane Powder.", "Mana-heavy without Arcane talents.", "Blizzard does this better for Frost."}, icons = {"spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_frost_frostblast", "spell_holy_magicalsentry", "spell_holy_arcaneintellect", "spell_nature_starfall", "spell_fire_selfdestruct"}}, {level = 58, spells = {"Ice Barrier (Rank 4)", "Cone of Cold (Rank 5)", "Conjure Mana Ruby", "Mage Armor (Rank 3)", "Scorch (Rank 7)"}, notes = {"New rank of your shield.", "Burst and slow on packs.", "Best mana gem.", "Swap to it if mana, not damage, is your problem.", "Fire filler; not needed for Frost."}, icons = {"spell_ice_lament", "spell_frost_glacier", "inv_misc_gem_ruby_01", "spell_magearmor", "spell_fire_soulburn"}}, {level = 60, spells = {"Frostbolt (Rank 11)", "Blizzard (Rank 6)", "Ice Armor (Rank 4)", "Mana Shield (Rank 6)", "Conjure Water (Rank 7)", "Conjure Food (Rank 7)", "Polymorph (Rank 4)", "Frostfire Bolt (Rank 3)", "Frost Ward (Rank 5)", "Fire Ward (Rank 5)", "Dampen Magic (Rank 5)", "Fireball (Rank 12)"}, notes = {"Your main nuke. Always train new ranks.", "Your main pack-killer.", "More armor than Frost Armor. Keep it on while questing.", "Emergency absorb before Ice Barrier.", "Free drinks — saves a lot of gold.", "Free food.", "Sheep the extra mob.", "Fire-Frost hybrid; Frostbol