h (Rank 4)", "Feint (Rank 5)", "Rupture (Rank 6)", "Backstab (Rank 9)"}, notes = {"Your main finisher.", "Your main-hand poison.", "Off-hand poison from 30.", "Incapacitate 4 sec — reset or interrupt.", "Sneak up and pick your fights.", "Drop threat in groups.", "Long fights only.", "Ranks 8 and 9."}, icons = {"ability_rogue_eviscerate", "ability_poisons", "ability_rogue_dualweild", "ability_gouge", "ability_stealth", "ability_rogue_feint", "ability_rogue_rupture", "ability_backstab"}}}, br = {{level = 1, icon = "spell_shadow_ritualofsacrifice", title = "Before Talents", range = "Levels 1–9", intro = "Sinister Strike to build combo points, Eviscerate to spend them. Energy refills smoothly in Forever — 10 a second, no ticks to wait for.", steps = {"Fight (Sinister Strike) to 3 combo points, then Finish (Eviscerate).", "Stealth up to a mob, then open with Sinister Strike.", "Gouge (6) to stop a caster or buy time to bandage: Stop a cast (RT+X) casts it until Kick at 12.", "Evasion (8) when a fight goes wrong."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_ritualofsacrifice", "ability_stealth", "ability_gouge", "spell_shadow_shadowward"}}, {level = 10, icon = "ability_rogue_slicedice", title = "Slice and Dice", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Slice and Dice speeds up your attacks. Put it up at 2 combo points, then build for Eviscerate.", steps = {"Fight to 2 points → Finish (Slice and Dice) → Fight to 5 → Finish (Eviscerate).", "Kick (12) casters: Stop a cast (RT+X) kicks the enemy under your mouse first.", "Sprint (10) away from a bad pull.", "Controller: Fight (RT+A) builds, Finish (RT+B) spends: Slice and Dice first, then Eviscerate."}, stepIcons = {"ability_rogue_slicedice", "ability_kick", "ability_rogue_sprint", "inv_misc_note_01"}}, {level = 20, icon = "ability_warrior_challange", title = "Riposte & Poisons", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Riposte (20) lights up after a parry. Poisons arrive at 20 — coat your main hand with Instant Poison.", steps = {"Riposte rides on Fight: it fires with your next Sinister Strike after a parry.", "Instant Poison on your weapons — reapply after 30 min or when the charges run out.", "Vanish (22) to escape a fight you can't win: Escape (LT+Y) is Vanish and Sprint.", "Shank (24): off-hand strike that gives back Energy — the 24+ Fight macro uses it.", "Cheap Shot (26): Fight opens with it from Stealth."}, stepIcons = {"ability_warrior_challange", "ability_poisons", "ability_vanish", "ability_theblackarrow", "ability_cheapshot"}}, {level = 30, icon = "ability_warrior_punishingblow", title = "Blade Flurry", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Blade Flurry (30) hits two mobs at once. Deadly Poison (30) goes on your off-hand.", steps = {"Two mobs? Burst (RT+Y): Blade Flurry and Evasion, then Fight.", "Kidney Shot (30) on a dangerous mob.", "Blind (34) a second mob while you kill the first.", "Deadly Poison on the off-hand, Instant on the main hand."}, stepIcons = {"ability_warrior_punishingblow", "ability_rogue_kidneyshot", "spell_shadow_mindsteal", "ability_rogue_dualweild"}}, {level = 40, icon = "spell_shadow_shadowworddominate", title = "Adrenaline Rush", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Adrenaline Rush (40) doubles Energy regen for 15 sec. With Blade Flurry it melts packs.", steps = {"Big pull: Burst twice (Blade Flurry, then Adrenaline Rush), then Fight.", "Shank rank 2 (44) + Flash of Steel 5/5: 40 Energy back for 5, every 8 sec — the Fight macro fires it.", "Evasion every 2 min with Endurance: Burst casts it with Blade Flurry."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_shadowworddominate", "ability_theblackarrow", "spell_shadow_shadowward"}}}, spec = "Combat", guide = "Combat Rogue"},
  SHAMAN = {macros = {
    {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_nature_lightning", lo = 1, hi = 3,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/targetenemy [noharm][dead]\n/startattack\n/cast [nocombat] Lightning Bolt", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Lightning Bolt to pull, and your swings start once the mob reaches you. In combat a press just keeps you swinging.", "No living enemy targeted: the press picks the nearest one first, so RT+A / 1 also finds the next mob after a kill."}},
    {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_nature_earthshock", lo = 4, hi = 9,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/targetenemy [noharm][dead]\n/startattack\n/cast [nocombat] Lightning Bolt; Earth Shock", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Lightning Bolt to pull. In combat: Earth Shock (4), 6 sec cooldown; between shocks a press does nothing and you keep swinging.", "Shocks cost a lot of mana this early: shock the tough mobs and let your weapon do the rest."}},
    {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_fire_flameshock", lo = 10, hi = 24,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/targetenemy [noharm][dead]\n/startattack\n/cast [nocombat] Lightning Bolt\n/castsequence [combat] reset=target Flame Shock, Earth Shock", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Lightning Bolt to pull. In combat: Flame Shock (10), then Earth Shock, taking turns; a new target starts with Flame Shock.", "All shocks share one 6 sec cooldown, so the sequence waits for it. Nothing else on this button could go in that time, so nothing is lost: keep pressing, you keep swinging.", "Stormstrike takes this button over at 25; the shocks then move to Shock (RT+Y / 4)."}},
    {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "ability_shaman_stormstrike", lo = 25, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/targetenemy [noharm][dead]\n/startattack\n/cast [nocombat] Lightning Bolt; Stormstrike\n/cast [combat] Rage of the Farseer", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Lightning Bolt to pull. In combat: Stormstrike (6 sec cooldown). Alternate it with Shock (RT+Y / 4): both come back every 6 sec, and the Earth Shock after a Stormstrike hits 20% harder.", "From 40 the same press fires Rage of the Farseer whenever it is ready (3 min cooldown): +30% attack speed for 25 sec, no extra press.", "A dodge or parry can reset Stormstrike (Improved Stormstrike, 31): press again right away. At 5 Maelstrom Weapon stacks (35+), Lightning Bolt from your bar is instant and free."}},
    {name = "Shock", title = "Shock", icon = "spell_fire_flameshock", lo = 25, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/targetenemy [noharm][dead]\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Flame Shock, Earth Shock", pad = "RT+Y", kb = "4",
     tips = {"Each press: Flame Shock, then Earth Shock, taking turns; a new target starts with Flame Shock, which then ticks for 12 sec.", "All shocks share one 6 sec cooldown: the sequence just waits for it, nothing is lost. Press it between your Stormstrikes (Fight, RT+A / 1)."}},
    {name = "Interrupt", title = "Interrupt", icon = "spell_nature_earthshock", lo = 4, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip Earth Shock\n/stopcasting\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Earth Shock", pad = "LT+X", kb = "R",
     tips = {"One press: stops your own cast and Earth Shocks the enemy under your mouse, else your target. It interrupts the spell and locks that school for 2 sec.", "Shares the 6 sec shock cooldown: right after any shock it isn't ready, so keep a shock free when a caster is coming."}},
    {name = "Pack", title = "Pack", icon = "spell_fire_selfdestruct", lo = 26, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=combat Magma Totem, Fire Nova, Fire Nova", pad = "RT+B", kb = "2",
     tips = {"When 3 or more mobs are on you. Press 1: Magma Totem (20 sec). Presses 2 and 3: Fire Nova around it. The sequence waits on Fire Nova's 10 sec cooldown on purpose: two novas fit in one Magma Totem.", "It starts over at Magma Totem when the fight ends. Totem destroyed? Fire Nova needs a fire totem: press Totems (RT+X / 3) in combat for a Searing Totem."}},
    {name = "Totems", title = "Totems", icon = "spell_fire_searingtotem", lo = 10, hi = 19,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [combat] Searing Totem; Strength of Earth Totem", pad = "RT+X", kb = "3",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Strength of Earth Totem (5 min). In combat: Searing Totem at your feet; it lasts about 30 sec, so drop a new one each fight.", "Totems need their totem from the shaman quests (Earth at 4, Fire at 10). Call of the Elements takes the out-of-combat press over at 20."}},
    {name = "Totems", title = "Totems", icon = "spell_shaman_dropall_01", lo = 20, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [combat] Searing Totem; Call of the Elements", pad = "RT+X", kb = "3",
     tips = {"Out of combat: Call of the Elements drops every totem on your Totem Bar in one cast (set the bar first). In combat: just a new Searing Totem (30-55 sec).", "Buff totems last 5 min but stay where you dropped them: press it out of combat again at the next camp. Totemic Recall gives back 25% of their mana."}},
    {name = "Heal up", title = "Heal up", icon = "spell_nature_magicimmunity", lo = 1, hi = 19,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@targettarget,help,nodead][@player] Healing Wave", pad = "LT+A", kb = "Q",
     tips = {"One press: Healing Wave on the friend under your mouse, else your friendly target, else whoever your enemy target is hitting, else you. Solo that is you.", "Heal after the fight, not during: a hit pushes the cast back. Lesser Healing Wave joins at 20 for heals in combat."}},
    {name = "Heal up", title = "Heal up", icon = "spell_nature_healingwavelesser", lo = 20, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [combat,@mouseover,help,nodead][combat,help,nodead][combat,@targettarget,help,nodead][combat,@player] Lesser Healing Wave\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@targettarget,help,nodead][@player] Healing Wave", pad = "LT+A", kb = "Q",
     tips = {"In combat: Lesser Healing Wave (fast). Out of combat: Healing Wave (more healing per mana).", "Both go on the friend under your mouse, else your friendly target, else whoever your enemy target is hitting, else you. Solo that is you."}},
    {name = "Imbue", title = "Shield + imbue", icon = "spell_nature_lightningshield", lo = 8, hi = 29,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=15 Lightning Shield, Rockbiter Weapon", pad = "LT+Right", kb = "Shift+1",
     tips = {"Press 1: Lightning Shield (3 charges, 10 min). Press 2 within 15 sec: Rockbiter Weapon on your weapon (60 min). Then it starts over at the shield.", "No cooldowns, so it never stalls. Refresh the shield whenever it fades; the imbue once an hour. Windfury Weapon replaces Rockbiter at 30."}},
    {name = "Imbue", title = "Shield + imbue", icon = "spell_nature_cyclone", lo = 30, hi = 60,
     body = "#showtooltip\n/castsequence reset=15 Lightning Shield, Windfury Weapon", pad = "LT+Right", kb = "Shift+1",
     tips = {"Press 1: Lightning Shield (3 charges, 10 min). Press 2 within 15 sec: Windfury Weapon on your weapon (60 min). Then it starts over at the shield.", "No cooldowns, so it never stalls. Refresh the shield whenever it fades; the imbue once an hour. Windfury is best on a slow two-hander."}},
  }, plan = {{name = "Thundering Strikes", tree = "Enhancement", from = 10, to = 14, why = "+1% crit per point with melee, shocks and bolts — +5% by 14. Every melee crit will trigger Flurry later.", more = "+1% more crit.", max = 5, icon = "ability_thunderbolt"}, {name = "Mental Dexterity", tree = "Enhancement", from = 15, to = 17, why = "Attack Power equal to 50% of your Intellect, 150% at 3/3. Intellect gear now hits harder. Flurry needs this maxed.", more = "+50% more of your Intellect.", max = 3, icon = "spell_nature_mentalquickness"}, {name = "Ancestral Knowledge", tree = "Enhancement", from = 18, to = 19, why = "+Intellect: more mana and, through Mental Dexterity, more Attack Power.", more = "+2% more.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_grimward"}, {name = "Shamanistic Focus", tree = "Enhancement", from = 20, to = 20, why = "Shocks and Lightning Shield cost 45% less mana — you can shock on every 6 sec cooldown.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_nature_elementalabsorption"}, {name = "Elemental Weapons", tree = "Enhancement", from = 21, to = 23, why = "Rockbiter's Attack Power +7% per point (+20% at 3/3); at 3/3 Windfury is 40% stronger from 30 and Flametongue 15%.", more = "Stronger weapon imbues.", max = 3, icon = "spell_fire_flametounge"}, {name = "Ancestral Knowledge", tree = "Enhancement", from = 24, to = 24, why = "One more Intellect point to open row 4 for Stormstrike.", more = "", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_grimward"}, {name = "Stormstrike", tree = "Enhancement", from = 25, to = 25, why = "Stormstrike: a 150% weapon hit every 6 sec for 8% of base mana; your next Earth Shock within 12 sec deals 20% more. Fight (RT+A) casts it from here.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "ability_shaman_stormstrike"}, {name = "Flurry", tree = "Enhancement", from = 26, to = 30, why = "After a melee crit your next 3 swings are 6% faster per point — 30% at 5/5.", more = "+6% more.", max = 5, icon = "ability_ghoulfrenzy"}, {name = "Improved Stormstrike", tree = "Enhancement", from = 31, to = 32, why = "50% chance per Stormstrike of 50% mana regen while casting for 15 sec, and a 50% chance a dodge or parry resets its cooldown.", more = "Now 100% for both.", max = 2, icon = "spell_shaman_improvedstormstrike"}, {name = "Mental Quickness", tree = "Enhancement", from = 33, to = 34, why = "Spell damage +15% of your Intellect, 30% at 2/2 — bigger shocks and bolts. Rage of the Farseer requires it.", more = "30% of your Intellect.", max = 2, icon = "spell_nature_sleep"}, {name = "Maelstrom Weapon", tree = "Enhancement", from = 35, to = 39, why = "Melee hits have a chance to stack it (up to 5, 30 sec). Each stack is 4% per point: at 5/5 and 5 stacks, Lightning Bolt is instant and free.", more = "+4% more per stack.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shaman_maelstromweapon"}, {name = "Rage of the Farseer", tree = "Enhancement", from = 40, to = 40, why = "The capstone: +30% attack speed for 25 sec, 3 min cooldown. Fight fires it with a Stormstrike when it is ready.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_nature_bloodlust"}, {name = "Improved Ghost Wolf", tree = "Enhancement", from = 41, to = 42, why = "Ghost Wolf's 3 sec cast drops to 2 sec and works indoors.", more = "Now instant — less time walking.", max = 2, icon = "spell_nature_spiritwolf"}, {name = "Spirit Weapons", tree = "Enhancement", from = 43, to = 43, why = "Parry chance, so Improved Stormstrike resets more often. 30% less threat on Windfury (30% more on Rockbiter).", more = "", max = 1, icon = "ability_parry"}, {name = "Ancestral Knowledge", tree = "Enhancement", from = 44, to = 45, why = "Ancestral Knowledge to 5/5.", more = "+2% more.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_grimward"}, {name = "Anticipation", tree = "Enhancement", from = 46, to = 48, why = "+2% dodge per point, 6% by 48: fewer hits taken and more Stormstrike resets. Enhancement is done.", more = "+2% more.", max = 3, icon = "spell_nature_mirrorimage"}, {name = "Tidal Focus", tree = "Restoration", from = 49, to = 52, why = "Restoration row 1: 